{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42755","headline":"秋夕书事 · 刘兼","name":"秋夕书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇落江天万木空，雁行斜戛塞垣风。\n征闺捣月离愁远，旧馆眠云旅梦通。\n郢客岂能陪下里，臯禽争肯恋樊笼。\n此心旷荡谁相会，尽在南华十卷中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}